      "description": "Mount Rinjani located in the North of Lombok 85 km from Senggigi. Mount Rinjani is the second highest volcano in Indonesia standing at majestic 3726 masl. For the people of Lombok Sasak and Balinese alike, treat the mountain as a sacred place. One of the large crater called Segara Anak Lake, located at 2000 masl. This magnificent crater lake now holds a new and active volcano called Mount Baru Jari which appeared in this country. On the Northside of the lake, there is a hot spring (one of 4 Segara Anak hot springs found here) which is said to cure disease.",
